            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Raquel Foote"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this recipe and loved it!! I made my own cake vodka using karkov and white cake in a mason jar after letting it sit for two days... and straining it, the cake was still edible just tasty and potent.",
            "datePublished": "2016-01-20T16:47:08.017Z"
          },
