              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SillyBoba1622"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love making this! I mix the Pinnacle Birthday Cake or Whipped flavor if I can't find the Birthday Cake flavor, with Amaretto, pineapple juice and grenadine. It's always a hit when I make this drink for my family &amp; friends! 😋🍹",
            "datePublished": "2023-10-28T05:55:28.623Z"
