            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dottie Snyder"
            },
            "reviewBody": "EXECELENT drink for the summer.\n@ Anne, if you can't find the cake vodka (I've never seen it before either), use a 1 oz. shot of each Buttershot Schnapps, Peach Schnapps, Almeretto, and 3 ozs. pineapple juice. Use a drop or 2 of the cherry juice for the grenadine. This is the way I make it and it taste just like a liquid PUSDC",
            "datePublished": "2012-04-17T09:59:42.107Z"
          },
          {
