              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tina A Damouth"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Easy enough to make by the pitcher. Taste just like the real thing. Though my husband wouldnt know since he claims never to have had it in cake form. Made ahead of time and kept chilled in the fridge. Done more drinking this week along with this stuff then all of last year...",
